# Project skills

Before **any implementation** in this repo, read every file in [`.cursor/skills/`](../skills/) and decide which apply from each file's `description` in the frontmatter.

Do not skip this step for "small" changes. Question-only or review-only tasks do not require reading skills unless they touch integration patterns below.

## Which skill to follow

| Task | Skill file |
|------|------------|
| REST API endpoints only (no Admin Next UI) | [`grav-api-integration.md`](../skills/grav-api-integration.md) |
| Admin2 / `onApi*` / `admin-next/` / blueprint hooks / custom fields / widgets | [`grav-api-admin-next-integration.md`](../skills/grav-api-admin-next-integration.md) |

Use the **narrowest** match: if the task is API-only, use `grav-api-integration`. If it includes any Admin Next surface, use `grav-api-admin-next-integration` (it covers API patterns too).

## Workflow

1. List and read applicable skill(s) in full before writing code.
2. Follow that skill's steps (analyze → implement → test; Section K config audit when admin UI is involved).
3. Keep changes in this plugin directory per [scope-badger-builder.mdc](scope-badger-builder.mdc).

## Related rules

- [grav-core.mdc](grav-core.mdc) — never modify `system/` or `vendor/`
- [changelog.mdc](changelog.mdc) — append task summary to `.cursor/notes/changelog.md` when a task is completed
